{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Morsel 是一款以照片估算卡路里與營養素的飲食記錄 App，適合想快速記錄飲食、又不想逐項手動輸入的人。它可從餐點照片估算熱量和營養素，原價 US $6.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460bb-75-1.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>照片估算卡路里</h2>\n<p>Morsel 以餐點照片估算熱量與營養素，拍攝後可放下手機，估算會在背景完成，即使關閉 App 或失去訊號亦不影響記錄。用家可連接 OpenRouter，或貼上 OpenRouter、OpenAI、Anthropic 的 API 金鑰，按次向供應商付費，通常每張照片低於一美分；沒有供應商時，餐點會先儲存並等候連接。所有照片與記錄留在 iPhone，亦可選擇以 iCloud 同步及匯出 CSV。</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/320x480bb-6.jpg\" width=\"221\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/320x480bb-7.jpg\" width=\"221\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/320x480bb-8.jpg\" width=\"221\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/320x480bb-9.jpg\" width=\"221\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/320x480bb-10.jpg\" width=\"221\"/></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/320x480bb-11.jpg\" width=\"221\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p>取得免費 API 方式，用戶要 App 內選定 Openrouter，然後設定為 Free Model，這樣就能免費使用 AI 偵測卡路里！</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"IMG 6890\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/IMG_6890-473x1024.webp\" width=\"473\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Morsel – AI Calorie Tracker</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/morsel-ai-calorie-tracker/id6826828497\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li>\n</ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T11:03:52.566951+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":440,"images":8,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T10:50:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T17:37:55.107229+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T10:57:23.710070+00:00","content_hash":"a2d61a8c799f9a0a4f9dbc4de08df6ff55f89ebf063ed2644ed3a33e37093dbd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}